 const paragraphs={en:'A reading column connects one line to the next. Its useful width depends on the words, the font and the space between lines. Compare the same passage at several measures before deciding whether the text is comfortable to follow. A heading and a wide table serve other purposes and need not share this limit.', 'zh-Hant':'閱讀欄位讓視線從一行連接到下一行。適合的寬度取決於實際文字、字體與行距。請使用相同段落比較不同欄寬，再判斷是否容易閱讀。標題與資料表有不同的用途，不必套用相同的行長限制。',mixed:'閱讀 Field notes 2026 時，請比較實際文字與數字的寬度。The zero glyph does not represent every character in a mixed-script paragraph. 保留標點與原始內容，再檢查換行、字體載入與段落間距。'}
